10.1 Optional Study Agreement. On or after the date when the Generator 
receives Interconnection System Impact Study results, the Generator may 
request, and the Transmission Provider shall perform a reasonable 
number of Optional Studies. The request shall describe the assumptions 
that the Generator wishes the Transmission Provider to study within the 
